  <text>
    <body>
      <div type="clause" n="1.1">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:Had">Had.</ref> 1.1</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">And eallum Godes freondum gebirað swiðe rihte, þæt hi Godes cirican lufian 7 wurðian 7 Godes þeowas friðian 7 nerian.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">And to all friends of God it belongs rightly that they love and honour God's church and protect and defend God's servants.</ab>
        <ab type="supplementaryText" xml:lang="und">7 eallum Godes freondum gebyreþ swyþe rihte, þæt hi Godes cyrcan lufian 7 wurþian 7 Godes þeowas friðian 7 griþian.</ab>
        <ab type="supplementaryTranslation" xml:lang="en">And very rightly, it is proper for all friends of God that they love God's Church and venerate it, and preserve and protect God's servants.</ab>
      </div>
    </body>
